{"title":"홍련의 화살","artist":"Linked Horizon","sourceId":"reference:u269FmTaKWjhdPZt9Dxc","sourceHash":"2e33735ed2fc2ca32c04264f1cf8bb28fa516769bcb7652c401ddf0537af6be1","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":20.81,"end":23.81,"text":"Seid ihr das Essen? Nein, wir sind der Jäger!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":23.99,"end":26.99,"text":"Feuerroter pfeil und bogen...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":35.71,"end":38.71,"text":"踏まれた花の 名前も知らずに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":40.73,"end":43.73,"text":"地に墜ちた落ちた鳥は 風を待ちわびる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":46.11,"end":49.11,"text":"祈ったところで 何も変わらない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":51.44,"end":54.44,"text":"《不本意な現状》を変えるのは 戦う覚悟だ...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":56.76,"end":59.2,"text":"屍踏み越えて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":59.2,"end":62.02,"text":"進む意思を 嗤う豚よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":62.02,"end":63.22,"text":"家畜の安寧...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":63.22,"end":64.46,"text":"虚偽の繁栄...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":64.46,"end":67.22,"text":"死せる餓狼の「自由」を！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":67.22,"end":70.22,"text":"囚われた屈辱は 反撃の嚆だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":72.76,"end":75.76,"text":"城壁の其の彼方 獲物を屠る《狩人》","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":78.0,"end":81.0,"text":"迸る《殺意》に 其の身を灼きながら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":83.39,"end":85.66,"text":"黄昏に緋を穿つ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":85.66,"end":88.66,"text":"紅蓮の弓矢","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":110.08,"end":113.08,"text":"矢を番え追い駈ける 標的は逃がさない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":115.1,"end":118.1,"text":"矢を放ち追い詰める 決して逃がさない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":120.36,"end":123.36,"text":"限界まで引き絞る はち切れそうな弦","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":125.85,"end":128.85,"text":"「標的」が息絶えるまで 何度でも放つ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":131.15,"end":133.64,"text":"獲物を殺すのは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":133.64,"end":136.64,"text":"「凶器」でも 技術でもない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":136.85,"end":139.85,"text":"研ぎ澄まされた お前自身の殺意だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":141.88,"end":144.88,"text":"Wir sind die Jäger 焔のように熱く!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":146.84,"end":149.84,"text":"Wir sind die Jäger 氷のように冷ややかに!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":152.31,"end":155.31,"text":"Wir sind die Jäger 己を矢に込めて!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":157.48,"end":160.48,"text":"Wir sind die Jäger 全てを貫いて征け!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":195.93,"end":198.82999999999998,"text":"Angriff auf die Titanen","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":198.82999999999998,"end":201.82999999999998,"text":"Der Junge von einst wird bald zum Schwert greifen","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":207.84,"end":210.84,"text":"Wer nur seine Machtlosigkeit beklagt. Kann nichts verändern","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":213.37,"end":216.37,"text":"Der Junge von einst wird bald das schwarze Schwert ergreifen","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":218.47,"end":221.47,"text":"Hass und Zorn sind eine zweischneidige Klinge","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":222.99,"end":225.99,"text":"Bald, eines Tages, wird er dem Schicksal die Zähne zeigen","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":229.18,"end":232.18,"text":"何かを変える事が出来るのは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":234.42000000000002,"end":237.42000000000002,"text":"何かを捨てる事が出来るもの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":239.43,"end":242.43,"text":"何ひとつ「危険性」等 背負わないままで 何かが叶う等...","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":249.19,"end":252.19,"text":"暗愚の想定 唯の幻影 今は無謀な勇気も","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":254.48,"end":257.21,"text":"「自由」の尖兵 賭けの攻勢","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":257.21,"end":260.0,"text":"奔る奴隷に勝利を!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":260.0,"end":263.0,"text":"架せられた不条理は 進撃の嚆だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":265.26,"end":268.26,"text":"奪われた其の地平「自由」を望むあの日の《少年》","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":270.73,"end":273.73,"text":"止めどなき《殺意》に 其の身を侵されながら 宵闇に紫を運ぶ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":278.65999999999997,"end":281.65999999999997,"text":"冥府の弓矢","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}